---
source: crates/gwsim-data/tests/descriptions.rs
expression: "[render(\"Heal(to: TargetAlly, amount: Min(PerUnit(value: Fixed(1), of: HealthLost), Scaled(15, 80)))\"),\nrender(\"GainEnergy(to: Self, amount: Max(Fixed(1), Scaled(3, 12)))\"),].join(\"\\n\")"
---
Target ally gains 1 health per point of health lost, up to 15…80.
You gain 1 energy, at least 3…12.
